{{also|Woensdag}}
==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|woensdach}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|*wuodenesdag}}, from {{inh|nl|gmw-pro|*Wōdanas dag||day of Woden}}, calque of {{der|nl|la|dies Mercurii}}.

[[Woden]] or [[Wodan]] was the supreme [[Germanic]] god.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nl|/ˈʋunz.dɑx/}}
* {{audio|nl|Nl-woensdag.ogg|audio}}
* {{hyphenation|nl|woens|dag}}

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|m|-:en|woensdagje}}

# [[Wednesday]]
#:{{ux|nl|inline=1|Elke '''woensdag''' ga ik naar yoga.|Every '''Wednesday''' I go to yoga.}}
#:{{ux|nl|inline=1|De '''woensdagen''' voelen als het midden van de week.|The '''Wednesdays''' feel like the middle of the week.}}
#:{{ux|nl|inline=1|We hadden een heerlijk '''woensdagje''' samen.|We had a wonderful '''Wednesday''' together.}}

